{
	"shows": "On Agent Platform's Chat Completions API for open models, Google refuses a max_tokens above 131,072 for gpt-oss-120b and above 32,768 for Gemma 4 26B A4B, and above the context window of 1,048,576 tokens for DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 and GLM-5.2, for which the model's server answers 200 with an error, which Google sometimes turns into its own 400, and Google answers 400 when the request streams. It takes the output limits of the Gemma 4 and DeepSeek deployments, refuses those of gpt-oss-120b and GLM-5.2 as over the context window, which they equal, and answers a max_tokens of 0 with an empty reply that ends for its length.",
